---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="On-Chain Proof"
  path="/on-chain"
  description="Verifiable Move package addresses on Sui mainnet and reproducible CI verification for every live Northlatch Labs product."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow-pill"><i></i>Public Verification</span>
        <h1>Verifiable on Sui mainnet.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Every product claim on northlatch.tech is backed by published packages and inspectable source code. Review our live mainnet deployments below without needing to ask our sales team for access.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="markfig">
        <div class="markfield" data-mark="hero" data-mark-seq="mark,sui" role="img" aria-label="Animated geometric blocks forming the Sui mark."></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;border-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="table-wrap" data-reveal>
        <table class="pk">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Package</th>
              <th>Mainnet Address</th>
              <th class="r">Version &amp; Modules</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="accent"><strong>weir core</strong></td>
              <td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0xdc6dbb96885ba049c5d860d0b775b9e968cf9053a227861ae006f22e352884b5">0xdc6dbb96885ba049c5d860d0b775b9e968cf9053a227861ae006f22e352884b5</a></td>
              <td class="r num">v5 &middot; account, creator, entitlement, key_registry, platform, stake</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="accent"><strong>weir core (original)</strong></td>
              <td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0xc5c833991ed1123d70b1001c0bcdb01ec5728b09f25dfc42a0edaf16005d404d">0xc5c833991ed1123d70b1001c0bcdb01ec5728b09f25dfc42a0edaf16005d404d</a></td>
              <td class="r num">v5 lineage root &middot; Seal namespace package</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="accent"><strong>weir payments (USDC)</strong></td>
              <td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0xdba34672e30cb065b1f93e3ab55318768fd6fef66c15942c9f7cb846e2f900e7">0xdba34672e30cb065b1f93e3ab55318768fd6fef66c15942c9f7cb846e2f900e7</a></td>
              <td class="r num">v1 &middot; usdc</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="accent"><strong>weir key server</strong></td>
              <td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0x9636e0c761e7476b8579cb13d543838e3732ca482dc0a64f086f57b60c024e23">0x9636e0c761e7476b8579cb13d543838e3732ca482dc0a64f086f57b60c024e23</a></td>
              <td class="r num">v5 &middot; key_server, hmac, kdf, gf256</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="accent"><strong>projectx_raffle</strong></td>
              <td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0xb475146208b53d16c3498c9757d623386c17fc197df544386ed496a74e79f8ee">0xb475146208b53d16c3498c9757d623386c17fc197df544386ed496a74e79f8ee</a></td>
              <td class="r num">v6 &middot; fenwick, raffle_v1</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="accent"><strong>northlatch_soul</strong></td>
              <td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0x8d6567ed7bf34d99eefefe745c3a282fd89a12fdcd77e6bd10b19b35b599635f">0x8d6567ed7bf34d99eefefe745c3a282fd89a12fdcd77e6bd10b19b35b599635f</a></td>
              <td class="r num">v1 &middot; soul</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="small faint" style="margin-top:16px" data-reveal>
        Every published package behind our live products is listed with its full Sui mainnet address (resolved over Sui GraphQL on 2026-11-25). Accounts and vaults are live objects rather than packages, and are linked directly on the <a href="/agents" class="accent">Agents page</a>.
      </p>

      <div class="twocol" style="margin-top:48px">
        <div data-reveal>
          <p class="cmd">Reproducible Verification</p>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:10px">Run our CI gate suite locally.</h2>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:16px">Clone the public Verify repository and run the exact 25 verification steps executed in our own CI pipeline.</p>
          <div class="term">
            <div class="term-body">
              <div class="c">git clone https://github.com/Northlatch-Labs-LLC/protocolx-verify.git</div>
              <div class="c">cd protocolx-verify</div>
              <div class="c">bash scripts/run-self-gates.sh</div>
              <div class="out">&gt; runs the same 25 steps CI executes locally <span class="pass">[ ok ]</span></div>
              <div class="out">&gt; unavailable local steps are named and skipped explicitly</div>
              <div class="out">&gt; digest matches. exit 0</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-reveal>
          <p class="cmd">Open Artifacts</p>
          <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:16px">What your team can inspect today.</h2>
          <ul class="gets">
            <li>Full source code for the ProtocolX Verify GitHub Action and verification engine.</li>
            <li>Gate configurations and canonical evidence-manifest schema.</li>
            <li>Complete Move test corpus used by the automated test gate.</li>
            <li>Historical release digests tracked cleanly in git history since v0.1.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="actions" style="margin-top:24px">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/verify">Try Browser Bundle Verifier</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/contact#topic-sales">Talk to Engineering</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
